<title>SRI LANKA: Sri Lanka's benchmark 12-month T-bills unchanged.</title>
<headline>Sri Lanka's benchmark 12-month T-bills unchanged.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The average yields of 12-month treasury bills remained unchanged while three-months bills and six-month bills rose by 0.13 percentage points at Wednesday auction, the Central Bank said.</p>
<p>		   Bids received   Bids accepted   Avg yield</p>
<p>    3 months	 591		 591	  10.89 (10.76)</p>
<p>    6 months	 635		 395	  11.82 (11.69)</p>
<p>    12 months	465		 230	  12.74 (12.74)</p>
<p>    Total	  1,691		1,216</p>
<p>NOTE - Bids in million rupees, yields in percent (previous week's yields in brackets).</p>
<p>-- Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
</text>
